      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<title>The Process | ZAFIRA</title>\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the selective Zafira verification and event-matching process. Every connection begins with trust.\">\r\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\r\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\r\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\n  /* ── INLINE STYLES FOR PROCESS LUXURY EXPERIENCE ── */\r\n  :root { --p-bg: #0a0a0f; --p-gold: #C9A84C; --p-text: #e2e2e2; }\r\n  body { background-color: var(--p-bg); overflow-x: hidden; }\r\n  \r\n  /* Hero */\r\n  .p-hero { position: relative; min-height: 90vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; padding: 0 24px; }\r\n  .p-hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574360773950-48e024225301?q=80&w=2000'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; filter: brightness(0.35) contrast(1.1); transform: scale(1.05); transition: transform 2s ease-out; }\r\n  .p-hero.vis .p-hero-bg { transform: scale(1); }\r\n  .p-hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,15,0.8) 0%, rgba(10,10,15,0.3) 50%, var(--p-bg) 100%); z-index: 1; }\r\n  .p-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 800px; transform: translateY(30px); opacity: 0; transition: all 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.3s; }\r\n  .p-hero.vis .p-hero-content { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\r\n  .p-hero-title { font-family: var(--ff-d); font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem); font-weight: 500; color: var(--p-gold); letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 24px; text-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }\r\n  .p-hero-subtitle { font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem); color: var(--p-text); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }\r\n  \r\n  /* Steps */\r\n  .p-step-wrap { padding: 120px 24px; background: var(--p-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.05); }\r\n  .p-step-wrap:nth-child(even) { background: #0c0c11; }\r\n  .p-step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }\r\n  .p-step-content { max-width: 500px; }\r\n  .p-step-num { font-family: var(--ff-d); font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--p-gold); letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\r\n  .p-step-num::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 40px; height: 1px; background: var(--p-gold); }\r\n  .p-step-title { font-family: var(--ff-d); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.1; }\r\n  .p-step-desc { font-size: 1.05rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; }\r\n  \r\n  .p-step-img-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 2px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); aspect-ratio: 4/5; }\r\n  .p-step-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: brightness(0.7) grayscale(20%); transition: transform 1.5s ease, filter 1.5s ease; }\r\n  .p-step-img-wrap:hover .p-step-img { transform: scale(1.05); filter: brightness(0.9) grayscale(0%); }\r\n  \r\n  /* Alternate layout */\r\n  .p-step-wrap:nth-child(even) .p-step-content { order: 1; }\r\n  .p-step-wrap:nth-child(even) .p-step-img-wrap { order: 2; }\r\n  \r\n  @media(max-width: 900px) { \r\n    .p-step { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } \r\n    .p-step-wrap:nth-child(even) .p-step-content { order: 2; } \r\n    .p-step-wrap:nth-child(even) .p-step-img-wrap { order: 1; } \r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  /* Fade overrides */\r\n  .c-fade { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }\r\n  .c-fade.vis { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\r\n  .c-fade.d1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }\r\n  .c-fade.d2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }\r\n  .c-fade.d3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }\r\n</style>\r\n<script>\r\n(function(){\r\n  function getLang(){ return localStorage.getItem('zafiraLang')||'en'; }\r\n  function applyLang(lang){\r\n    localStorage.setItem('zafiraLang',lang);\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-'+lang+']').forEach(function(el){ el.textContent=el.getAttribute('data-'+lang); });\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-'+lang+'-html]').forEach(function(el){ el.innerHTML=el.getAttribute('data-'+lang+'-html'); });\r\n    document.querySelectorAll('.lang-btn').forEach(function(btn){ btn.classList.toggle('active', btn.getAttribute('data-lang')===lang); });\r\n  }\r\n  window.zafiraSetLang=function(lang){applyLang(lang);}\r\n  window.zafiraGetLang=function(){return getLang();}\r\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){ applyLang(getLang()); });\r\n})();\r\n</script>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<header class=\"nav\">\r\n  <div class=\"nav-in\">\r\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/\" class=\"nav-logo\"><img src=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/logo-1.png\" alt=\"\">ZAFIRA</a>\r\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\">\r\n      <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/proceso/\" data-en=\"Process\" data-es=\"Proceso\">Process</a>\r\n      <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/about/\" data-en=\"About\" data-es=\"Nosotros\">About</a>\r\n      <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/contact/\" data-en=\"Contact\" data-es=\"Contacto\">Contact</a>\r\n      <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/caballeros/\" class=\"nav-cta\" data-en=\"See if I qualify\" data-es=\"Comprobar si califico\">See if I qualify</a>\r\n      <div class=\"lang-switch\"><button class=\"lang-btn active\" data-lang=\"en\" onclick=\"zafiraSetLang('en')\">EN</button><button class=\"lang-btn\" data-lang=\"es\" onclick=\"zafiraSetLang('es')\">ES</button></div>\r\n    </nav>\r\n    <button class=\"nav-toggle\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('mob').classList.toggle('open')\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\r\n      <span></span><span></span><span></span>\r\n    </button>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div id=\"mob\" class=\"nav-mobile\">\r\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/proceso/\" data-en=\"Process\" data-es=\"Proceso\">Process</a>\r\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/about/\" data-en=\"About\" data-es=\"Nosotros\">About</a>\r\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/contact/\" data-en=\"Contact\" data-es=\"Contacto\">Contact</a>\r\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/caballeros/\" data-en=\"See if I qualify\" data-es=\"Comprobar si califico\">See if I qualify</a>\r\n    <div class=\"lang-switch\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"lang-btn active\" data-lang=\"en\" onclick=\"zafiraSetLang('en')\">EN</button><button class=\"lang-btn\" data-lang=\"es\" onclick=\"zafiraSetLang('es')\">ES</button></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n<main>\n\n  <!-- PORTADA (W30) -->\n  <section class=\"p-hero\" id=\"process-hero\">\n    <div class=\"p-hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"p-hero-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"p-hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"c-fade d1\"><span class=\"pill pill-gold\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;display:inline-flex;background:rgba(10,10,15,0.5)\" data-es=\"ZAFIRA • PROCESO PRIVADO\" data-en=\"ZAFIRA • PRIVATE PROCESS\">ZAFIRA • PRIVATE PROCESS</span></div>\n      <h1 class=\"p-hero-title c-fade d2\" data-es-html=\"Bienvenido al<br>proceso Zafira\" data-en-html=\"Welcome to the<br>Zafira process\">Welcome to the<br>Zafira process</h1>\n      <p class=\"p-hero-subtitle c-fade d3\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\" data-es=\"Encuentro privado y acompañado • Cartagena, Colombia\" data-en=\"Private, accompanied gathering • Cartagena, Colombia\">Private, accompanied gathering • Cartagena, Colombia</p>\n      <p class=\"p-hero-subtitle c-fade d3\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\" data-es=\"No es una plataforma de citas ni un evento abierto. Es un proceso privado, solo por invitación, para hombres de Estados Unidos que buscan una relación seria con intención de matrimonio: verificación de las dos partes, presentaciones solo cuando las dos personas aceptan y un encuentro privado en Cartagena, acompañado por Zafira.\" data-en=\"It is not a dating platform or an open event. It is a private, invitation-only process for men in the United States who want a serious relationship with marriage in mind: verification on both sides, introductions only when both people agree, and a private gathering in Cartagena, accompanied by Zafira.\">It is not a dating platform or an open event. It is a private, invitation-only process for men in the United States who want a serious relationship with marriage in mind: verification on both sides, introductions only when both people agree, and a private gathering in Cartagena, accompanied by Zafira.</p>\n      <p class=\"p-hero-subtitle c-fade d3\" style=\"margin-bottom:32px\" data-es=\"Octubre o noviembre de 2026. Fechas exactas, sede y cupos por confirmar; se confirman antes de abrir los cupos.\" data-en=\"October or November 2026. Exact dates, venue and places to be confirmed before places open.\">October or November 2026. Exact dates, venue and places to be confirmed before places open.</p>\n      <div class=\"c-fade d4\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn-gold\" style=\"padding:16px 32px\" data-es=\"Comprobar si califico\" data-en=\"See if I qualify\" href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/caballeros/\">See if I qualify</a>\n        <a class=\"\" style=\"color:var(--p-gold);text-decoration:none\" data-es=\"Conozca el proceso ↓\" data-en=\"See how it works ↓\" href=\"#pasos\">See how it works ↓</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- PASOS (W30) -->\n  <section class=\"p-step-wrap\" id=\"pasos\">\n    <div class=\"c-fade\" style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <h2 class=\"p-step-title\" data-es=\"El camino, en cinco pasos\" data-en=\"The path, in five steps\">The path, in five steps</h2>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px\" data-es=\"Solicitud sin costo → revisión preliminar → USD 400 de evaluación y verificación → aprobación → USD 13.000 del programa. En ese orden, y no hay otro.\" data-en=\"Free application → preliminary review → USD 400 evaluation and verification → approval → USD 13,000 programme. In that order, and there is no other.\">Free application → preliminary review → USD 400 evaluation and verification → approval → USD 13,000 programme. In that order, and there is no other.</p>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Paso 1 · Solicitud · Sin costo\" data-en=\"Step 1 · Application · Free\">Step 1 · Application · Free</div>\n        <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"Unos 4 minutos. Nos dice quién es y qué busca. Enviarla no genera ningún cobro.\" data-en=\"About 4 minutes. You tell us who you are and what you are looking for. Submitting it triggers no charge.\">About 4 minutes. You tell us who you are and what you are looking for. Submitting it triggers no charge.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Paso 2 · Revisión preliminar · Sin costo\" data-en=\"Step 2 · Preliminary review · Free\">Step 2 · Preliminary review · Free</div>\n        <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"La lee nuestro equipo. Si su perfil no encaja, se lo decimos ahí mismo y usted no ha pagado nada. Solo si su perfil puede avanzar, le explicamos el paso siguiente.\" data-en=\"Our team reads it. If your profile is not a fit, we tell you then, and you have paid nothing. Only if your profile can move forward do we explain the next step.\">Our team reads it. If your profile is not a fit, we tell you then, and you have paid nothing. Only if your profile can move forward do we explain the next step.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Paso 3 · Evaluación y verificación · USD 400\" data-en=\"Step 3 · Evaluation and verification · USD 400\">Step 3 · Evaluation and verification · USD 400</div>\n        <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"Entrevista, comprobación de identidad con documento oficial, antecedentes y estado civil. Se paga solo cuando le decimos que su perfil puede avanzar, y la verificación empieza el mismo día en que se recibe el pago. Después del pago, su asesor lo contacta en 48 horas hábiles para agendar la consulta inicial. No reserva cupo, no forma parte del programa ni se descuenta de él, y no es reembolsable una vez iniciada la evaluación, salvo el derecho de cancelación o retracto que le reconozca la ley aplicable.\" data-en=\"Interview, identity check against an official document, background and marital status. You pay it only when we tell you that your profile can move forward, and verification begins the same day the payment clears. After payment, your advisor contacts you within 48 business hours to schedule the initial consultation. It does not reserve a place, it is not part of the programme or credited toward it, and it is non-refundable once the evaluation has begun, except for any cancellation or withdrawal right granted by applicable law.\">Interview, identity check against an official document, background and marital status. You pay it only when we tell you that your profile can move forward, and verification begins the same day the payment clears. After payment, your advisor contacts you within 48 business hours to schedule the initial consultation. It does not reserve a place, it is not part of the programme or credited toward it, and it is non-refundable once the evaluation has begun, except for any cancellation or withdrawal right granted by applicable law.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Paso 4 · Aprobación\" data-en=\"Step 4 · Approval\">Step 4 · Approval</div>\n        <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"Zafira decide si usted entra al programa. Pagar la evaluación no es lo mismo que ser aprobado. Si no lo aprobamos, se lo decimos, el proceso termina ahí y los USD 400 no se devuelven: pagaron el estudio, y el estudio se hizo.\" data-en=\"Zafira decides whether you enter the programme. Paying for the evaluation is not the same as being approved. If you are not approved, we tell you, the process ends there and the USD 400 is not returned: it paid for the review, and the review was done.\">Zafira decides whether you enter the programme. Paying for the evaluation is not the same as being approved. If you are not approved, we tell you, the process ends there and the USD 400 is not returned: it paid for the review, and the review was done.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Paso 5 · El programa · USD 13.000\" data-en=\"Step 5 · The programme · USD 13,000\">Step 5 · The programme · USD 13,000</div>\n        <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"Pago único, solo si lo aprobamos y usted decide continuar. Recibe el contrato antes de cualquier cargo. Incluye la búsqueda personalizada según su perfil, la selección y verificación de cada candidata, presentaciones privadas solo cuando hay compatibilidad real y las dos personas aceptan, su matchmaker desde la aprobación hasta el encuentro, y la experiencia privada de Cartagena, organizada y cubierta por Zafira como se describe abajo. No incluye los vuelos de ida y regreso a Cartagena ni los gastos personales fuera de la programación oficial.\" data-en=\"A single payment, only if you are approved and decide to continue. You receive a contract before any charge. It includes a personal search built around your profile, the selection and verification of each candidate, private introductions only when there is real compatibility and both people agree, your matchmaker from approval to the gathering, and the private Cartagena experience, organised and covered by Zafira as described below. Not included: flights to and from Cartagena, and personal expenses outside the official programme.\">A single payment, only if you are approved and decide to continue. You receive a contract before any charge. It includes a personal search built around your profile, the selection and verification of each candidate, private introductions only when there is real compatibility and both people agree, your matchmaker from approval to the gathering, and the private Cartagena experience, organised and covered by Zafira as described below. Not included: flights to and from Cartagena, and personal expenses outside the official programme.</p>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"color:var(--p-gold)\" data-es=\"Si todo avanza, el recorrido completo es de USD 13.400. No hay ningún otro cobro.\" data-en=\"If everything moves forward, the full path is USD 13,400. There is no other charge.\">If everything moves forward, the full path is USD 13,400. There is no other charge.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ITINERARIO (W09, plan B) -->\n  <section class=\"p-step-wrap\" id=\"programa\" style=\"border-bottom:none\">\n    <div class=\"c-fade\" style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <h2 class=\"p-step-title\" data-es=\"Un programa privado y acompañado\" data-en=\"A private, accompanied programme\">A private, accompanied programme</h2>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"El encuentro de Cartagena no es un viaje de turismo ni un evento abierto. Es la extensión presencial de un trabajo que empezó mucho antes: la búsqueda, la verificación y el análisis de compatibilidad. Asisten solo caballeros aprobados en el programa y candidatas que pasaron por las cinco etapas y aceptaron, una por una, las presentaciones que se les propusieron.\" data-en=\"The Cartagena gathering is not a tourist trip or an open event. It is the in-person extension of work that began long before: the search, the verification and the compatibility analysis. Only gentlemen approved into the programme attend, together with candidates who have completed the five stages and accepted, one by one, the introductions proposed to them.\">The Cartagena gathering is not a tourist trip or an open event. It is the in-person extension of work that began long before: the search, the verification and the compatibility analysis. Only gentlemen approved into the programme attend, together with candidates who have completed the five stages and accepted, one by one, the introductions proposed to them.</p>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\" data-es=\"El programa detallado se entrega a los participantes aprobados cuando se confirman las fechas. Todas las presentaciones se preparan con anticipación y solo cuando las dos personas las han aceptado, y el equipo de Zafira está presente y pendiente de los dos lados.\" data-en=\"The detailed schedule is shared with approved participants once the dates are confirmed. Every introduction is prepared in advance and only when both people have agreed to it, and the Zafira team is present and attentive to both sides.\">The detailed schedule is shared with approved participants once the dates are confirmed. Every introduction is prepared in advance and only when both people have agreed to it, and the Zafira team is present and attentive to both sides.</p>\n      <h3 class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Reglas de privacidad, para proteger a todos\" data-en=\"Privacy rules that protect everyone\">Privacy rules that protect everyone</h3>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0 0 40px 20px\">\n        <li class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\" data-es=\"No se toman ni se comparten fotografías de otros participantes.\" data-en=\"Photographs of other participants are not taken or shared.\">Photographs of other participants are not taken or shared.</li>\n        <li class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\" data-es=\"No se publica el nombre ni la imagen de nadie.\" data-en=\"No one's name or image is published.\">No one's name or image is published.</li>\n        <li class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\" data-es=\"Ningún dato de contacto se comparte sin el consentimiento de la persona y el procedimiento que corresponda.\" data-en=\"No contact details are shared without the person's consent and the procedure that applies.\">No contact details are shared without the person's consent and the procedure that applies.</li>\n        <li class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\" data-es=\"Cada candidata solo coincide con caballeros cuya presentación ya aceptó, después del procedimiento que corresponda.\" data-en=\"Each candidate only meets gentlemen whose introduction she has already accepted, after the procedure that applies.\">Each candidate only meets gentlemen whose introduction she has already accepted, after the procedure that applies.</li>\n        <li class=\"p-step-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\" data-es=\"Cualquier comportamiento irrespetuoso es causa de salida inmediata del programa.\" data-en=\"Any disrespectful behaviour means immediate removal from the programme.\">Any disrespectful behaviour means immediate removal from the programme.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3 class=\"p-step-num\" data-es=\"Qué cubre Zafira y qué no\" data-en=\"What Zafira covers, and what it does not\">What Zafira covers, and what it does not</h3>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"Para el caballero, dentro del programa de USD 13.000, desde su llegada al aeropuerto de Cartagena y durante las fechas oficiales: recepción y traslado desde el aeropuerto; alojamiento durante los días establecidos; alimentación durante la experiencia; transporte local de las actividades organizadas; las actividades privadas del programa; los encuentros y presentaciones que organiza Zafira; logística, coordinación y el equipo de Zafira en sitio.\" data-en=\"Covered for the gentleman, within the USD 13,000 programme, from his arrival at Cartagena airport and during the official dates: reception and transfer from the airport; accommodation for the set days; meals during the experience; local transport for the organised activities; the private activities of the programme; the gatherings and introductions organised by Zafira; logistics, coordination and the Zafira team on site.\">Covered for the gentleman, within the USD 13,000 programme, from his arrival at Cartagena airport and during the official dates: reception and transfer from the airport; accommodation for the set days; meals during the experience; local transport for the organised activities; the private activities of the programme; the gatherings and introductions organised by Zafira; logistics, coordination and the Zafira team on site.</p>\n      <p class=\"p-step-desc\" data-es=\"No lo cubre: los vuelos de ida y regreso a Cartagena, los gastos personales fuera de la programación oficial y todo lo que no esté en esta lista.\" data-en=\"Not covered: flights to and from Cartagena, personal expenses outside the official programme, and anything not on this list.\">Not covered: flights to and from Cartagena, personal expenses outside the official programme, and anything not on this list.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CIERRE: solo el botón -->\n  <section class=\"sec text-center\" style=\"padding-bottom:120px;background:var(--black)\">\n    <div class=\"c-fade\"><a class=\"btn-gold\" style=\"padding:18px 50px;font-size:1rem\" data-es=\"Comprobar si califico\" data-en=\"See if I qualify\" href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/caballeros/\">See if I qu